          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            RMR-141 is a genuinely registered fungicide with a mild hazard profile and a clear, if demanding, 10-minute direction. It is the right product for mold on wood and framing you are keeping, and the four-pack of gallons is the right size for any basement or crawlspace job. It is the wrong product if you expect a stained wall to turn white.
          </p>
